user 13 columns 0 indexes 0 fks
verification 6 columns 1 indexes 0 fks
board 7 columns 2 indexes 1 fks
feedback_item 10 columns 5 indexes 2 fks
feedback_vote 4 columns 2 indexes 2 fks

[✓] Your SQL migration file ➜ ../../packages/database/src/schema/0002_puzzling_revanche.sql 🚀
